er networks, enhancing data transmission, or improving overall connectivity, this media converter is a cost-effective and powerful networking solution.</p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify; \"><b>Features of OTECH 10G SFP+ Case OT-SFC10GE Fiber Media Converter</b></h3><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">High-Speed Transmission – Supports a transmission rate of 8.5Gbps to 11.7Gbps, ensuring fast and stable data transfer.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">SFP+ Standard Slot – Equipped with an SFP+ interface, allowing flexible connectivity with various SFP+ modules.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Low Power Consumption – Operates at ≤4W, ensuring energy efficiency and cost-effective performance.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Reliable Power Supply – Uses a DC 12V input voltage, with an AC adapter included for easy installation.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Wide Operating Temperature Range – Functions efficiently in temperatures ranging from 0°C to 60°C, ensuring stability in different environments.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Compact and Space-Saving Design – Small 110mm (L) × 100mm (W) × 30mm (H) form factor for easy integration into existing network setups.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Seamless Fiber-to-Ethernet Conversion – Provides high-performance fiber-to-Ethernet connectivity for data centers, enterprises, and telecom applications.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Enhanced Network Expansion – Ideal for extending network coverage and improving data transmission efficiency.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Plug-and-Play Installation – Simple setup with minimal configuration required, making it user-friendly.</li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Versatile Application – Suitable for enterprise networks, data centers, and high-speed connectivity solutions.</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item 